<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαρν-έομαι</span></b> , aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηρνησάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.74
				</span></i>
			, 
				Att.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηρνήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					192e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				949a
			</span></i>, Cret. aor.
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαννήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			:—<i>deny utterly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φόνον</span> Hdt.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ τοι τοῦτό γ᾽ ἐξαρνήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					579
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤν τις ὀφείλων ἐξαρνῆται</span>”
				<i>should deny a debt,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					660
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ λαβεῖν ἐξαρνούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					27.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐ. πράττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.250
				</span></i>
			.</div>
